<title>USA: U.S. stocks rise slightly at the open.</title>
<headline>U.S. stocks rise slightly at the open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened slightly firmer on Tuesday as bargain hunters moved in after the Dow's choppy session on Monday.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials rose 9.95 to 7,868.44 at the start. The Nasdaq Composite up 1.53 at 1472.27, while S&amp;P Index up 0.15 at 912.35.</p>
<p>The 30-year long bond was off 7/32 at a 6.59 percent yield.</p>
